    Magento/blank stays the parent. Removing it (f76161e4) never reached any
    install that already had the theme: Magento keeps the parent it first
    registered, so every store kept inheriting Blank. Only a fresh install
    got no parent, and there Blank's etc/view.xml was missing: no product
    image sizes (category_page_grid, product_base_image...), so every
    product image was the placeholder. Found installing on a clean Magento
    2.4.7 (infra/terraform-test).
-->
<theme xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
       xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="urn:magento:framework:Config/etc/theme.xsd">
    <title>Zero</title>
    <parent>Magento/blank</parent>
</theme>
